WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your side with the top leg elevated on a bench or chair.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Lift the bottom leg to meet it, squeezing the inner thighs.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep hips stacked and body long.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Hold, then switch sides.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rest and notice the hips.
